WEBVTT

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:13.630
Did you forget?

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:17.680
The Divinity Sense's resistance destruction
can even nullify the Fighting Sense.

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:20.220
If things hadn't turned out this way...

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:22.940
I didn't want to think about it again.

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:24.980
Asahi is real.

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:27.570
My Divinity Sense tells me so.

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:30.190
And there's one more thing I know.

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:32.700
Asahi can't log out!

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:37.410
It's because in her state of existence
she has no way to do so.

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:40.830
Did your Divinity Sense tell you that too?

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.160
If Asahi can't leave,

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.080
I will stay by her side
and support her forever.

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:50.090
Are you crazy?
You plan on staying logged in forever?

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:52.630
I will walk along the same path with her.

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:55.890
I'm dedicating my entire life to keep this promise.

00:00:56.680 --> 00:01:00.600
Haruto, are you ready to spend
the rest of your life here?

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:02.980
Your commitment is impressive.

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:05.600
But have you considered how Asahi feels?

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:07.100
What do you mean?

00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:11.900
She's the type of person who would rather
resurrect Subaru than be able to log out.

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:15.360
I can protect Asahi alone.

00:01:15.530 --> 00:01:16.780
We don't need Subaru.

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:21.950
Shouldn't we keep searching
for a way to make her smile?

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:25.710
My Divinity Sense is always right.
It has never betrayed me.

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:28.920
Asahi can't log out.
That's why I--

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:31.960
Your Divinity Sense doesn't know
everything about the world!

00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:33.550
What?

00:01:34.010 --> 00:01:35.300
I saw it.

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:38.720
-When Asahi passed out when she looked at the stone--
-Shut up!

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:41.470
Don't you dare talk about Asahi!

00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:44.730
Get lost! Never come back!

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:48.230
Damn. Take that!

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:50.820
Disappear!

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:20.010
Seven Senses of the Re'Union

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:33.920
Swirling Conspiracy

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:42.300
I didn't think

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:45.510
it would be this difficult to destroy them.

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:47.310
Your Sense is powerful.

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:51.270
If you hurt Haruto,

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:53.560
I'll never forgive you.

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:54.980
Takanori!

00:03:55.150 --> 00:03:57.860
-You have no idea how much our leader cares about--
-Stop.

00:03:58.400 --> 00:04:01.400
You stop. This is enough.

00:04:01.780 --> 00:04:03.280
I know.

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:06.490
Even Asahi pointed her gun at me.

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:10.290
Satsuki, we're partners in crime.

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:12.710
I thought we had common interests.

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:15.830
Takanori.

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:20.090
Do you know where Clive and Nozomi are?

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:23.720
They're not within my sphere anymore.

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:28.470
We can't go back to how things were back then, Asahi.

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:31.140
Takanori...

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:34.270
Let's go back for now.

00:04:34.850 --> 00:04:36.560
Okay.

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:38.980
I'm going home for today.

00:04:39.940 --> 00:04:41.570
What? Hold on.

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:42.950
Sorry.

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:58.130
You look surprised.

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:02.840
As long as you're fighting over Asahi,
they won't take your offer.

00:05:03.050 --> 00:05:06.680
They're after the Prophet Art, not Asahi.

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:08.260
That is where we differ.

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:09.600
But...

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:13.180
Letos and Angelus
are seeking something else.

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:15.520
We all seek supremacy,

00:05:16.020 --> 00:05:20.900
but the higher-ranked guilds are in our way.

00:05:21.070 --> 00:05:23.900
Gnosis and Hyades.

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:28.410
The rumors say they're allowed to contact
the operating company directly.

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:33.410
It'd be impossible for a guild to overthrow
them alone. However...

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:36.290
If Southern Cross, the Brill Society,

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:38.790
and the Illuminati unite,

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:41.170
it might be possible.

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:42.880
Do you mean

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:47.260
it'd be more realistic for the three guilds
to fight for supremacy afterwards?

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:53.220
If the three guilds just sat there looking at
each other, we'd never reach our final goal.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:55.810
Come in.

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:57.560
Takanori!

00:05:57.940 --> 00:06:02.570
The leader of Southern Cross, Letos,
and the leader of the Brill Society, Angelus, are...

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:04.150
They know that

00:06:04.820 --> 00:06:07.700
better than anyone.

00:06:09.070 --> 00:06:11.280
I'll awaken Asahi.

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:14.240
That's also part of the role I must fulfill.

00:06:28.470 --> 00:06:29.470
Satsuki...

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:32.350
No way.

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:34.350
Don't look.

00:06:35.850 --> 00:06:37.020
Satsuki...

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:40.350
We're partners in crime.

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:52.990
No... I'm...

00:06:55.990 --> 00:06:59.500
She said she'll be late, so please go ahead.

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:02.670
I wonder if Satsuki's okay.

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:05.090
She didn't say why she'd be late.

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:08.170
She was acting strange yesterday.

00:07:08.590 --> 00:07:10.510
Maybe it's because I said that...

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:13.390
I don't think that's why.

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:18.310
We could be attacked at any time.

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:20.810
It's hard walking through the city.

00:07:21.350 --> 00:07:24.020
Isn't that the teleporter over there?

00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:27.650
How about going to the northernmost edge
of the Noachis continent?

00:07:36.030 --> 00:07:37.910
What a lonely village.

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:39.660
Look, Haruto!

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:41.620
Look at that!

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:43.580
It's a hot spring.

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:46.130
Let's get in.

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:48.050
We're not here to have fun.

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:50.590
It's good to have fun once in a while.

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:52.970
It's not okay even once in a while.

00:07:54.090 --> 00:07:57.220
That's the last player with the name Clive.

00:07:58.600 --> 00:07:59.680
What about Nozomi?

00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:06.360
There isn't anyone registered with that name
in the Noachis continent.

00:08:06.690 --> 00:08:08.530
What about the other continents?

00:08:08.940 --> 00:08:11.700
I can't extend my network to
the other continents.

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:16.450
You have to go yourself
and find a local informant.

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:19.950
If we're going to another continent,

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:22.830
we should talk to Satsuki again.

00:08:25.540 --> 00:08:28.420
We have to do something about your weapon.

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:29.710
That's true.

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:35.090
A common weapon would break easily
with the way I fight.

00:08:35.640 --> 00:08:36.890
This is my third.

00:08:37.220 --> 00:08:39.970
What about the one you had before, Pleiades?

00:08:40.310 --> 00:08:43.480
Things would be perfect if I still had that.

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:52.240
-There, there.
-Thanks for waiting.

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:55.700
Satsuki...

00:08:57.490 --> 00:08:59.370
You don't look well.

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:00.830
What?

00:09:01.330 --> 00:09:04.330
You were acting strange yesterday too.

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:06.380
And you were late today.

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:10.340
I'm fine. I was late
because I had a bad dream.

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:11.590
A dream?

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:14.170
Sorry about yesterday.

00:09:14.510 --> 00:09:17.220
I was overthinking things.

00:09:18.430 --> 00:09:20.470
So how was it?

00:09:24.890 --> 00:09:27.270
I see. That's too bad.

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:32.030
There aren't many teleporters good enough
to send us to another continent.

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:36.530
It's also likely that the people after Asahi
know about them already.

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:41.200
With this weather, we'd have to fly through the clouds.
It's dangerous.

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:46.000
We have to wait until the weather improves
so that we can fly.

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:47.710
Hey.

00:09:47.870 --> 00:09:50.090
Isn't the fog getting thicker?

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:55.300
-What's wrong?
-This fog...

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:59.590
It's a trap! It's the magic of 30--
No, 100 people!

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:01.680
All aimed at us!

00:10:02.010 --> 00:10:05.390
My Fighting Sense should have picked up on this.

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:06.940
I don't feel anything.

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:09.650
They've cloaked their presence.

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:12.770
This fog is made of complex, intertwined magic.

00:10:14.030 --> 00:10:16.070
There's some Empath Sense mixed in.

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:17.900
This unpleasant feeling.

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:21.620
Are they trying to brainwash us?

00:10:21.990 --> 00:10:23.040
Relax.

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:26.040
You're not who we're after.

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:42.220
Satsuki, can't you blow this fog away?

00:10:44.640 --> 00:10:46.390
Satsuki, answer me!

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:48.560
Asahi, stay close to me!

00:10:50.940 --> 00:10:53.440
-Asahi?
-We've succeeded.

00:10:56.990 --> 00:10:57.990
Letos!

00:10:58.450 --> 00:11:01.200
Welcome to the world of death!

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:04.580
The Brill Society?

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:11.670
They helped us erase our auras
and cover the entire village in fog.

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:14.540
The guilds were working together.

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:20.130
As long as you have a common purpose,
anyone would shake hands with the devil.

00:11:20.550 --> 00:11:22.680
Where did you take Satsuki and Asahi?

00:11:22.890 --> 00:11:24.220
Where?

00:11:26.520 --> 00:11:28.100
Look down at our feet.

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:30.350
Where am I?

00:11:31.060 --> 00:11:32.150
Was I transported?

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:34.940
I didn't take them anywhere.

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:38.150
You're the one who was flown here.

00:11:38.530 --> 00:11:43.240
There aren't a lot of divine champions who can do this.

00:11:43.870 --> 00:11:45.990
-Do you mean...?
-Southern Cross,

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:48.200
the Brill Society,

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:50.750
and the Illuminati, led by your old friend,

00:11:50.910 --> 00:11:53.130
have formed an alliance.

00:11:53.460 --> 00:11:56.380
Takanori! You'd go that far just to...?

00:11:57.170 --> 00:11:59.460
Where are Asahi and Satsuki?

00:12:01.300 --> 00:12:03.300
The Brill Society has surrounded Satsuki,

00:12:03.890 --> 00:12:07.100
and the Illuminati have surrounded Asahi.

00:12:11.980 --> 00:12:14.350
THE RULER OF WHITE DARKNESS
REVERSE RA

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:22.400
You small fry! Bring it on!

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:26.410
Where did you shoot that Empath Sense just now?

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:28.540
You don't need to know.

00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:31.290
A message card?

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:33.790
It's a present from Takanori Mikado.

00:12:36.710 --> 00:12:39.420
So, it was Takanori who transported
us to separate places.

00:12:39.670 --> 00:12:42.840
Without him we couldn't have created
this intricate fog

00:12:43.010 --> 00:12:45.550
while also being cloaked from your Sense.

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:51.810
Satsuki, I apologize for my impoliteness.

00:12:52.140 --> 00:12:53.810
I'll get straight to the point.

00:12:53.980 --> 00:12:58.110
I'm sure things would be better for you
if Asahi didn't exist in this world.

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:01.860
Asahi doesn't exist in the real world.

00:13:02.150 --> 00:13:05.570
And you were reunited with Haruto in the real world.

00:13:06.110 --> 00:13:10.330
Why does Re'Union mean anything to you?

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:12.540
You and I are opposites.

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:15.370
After I was reunited with Asahi here,

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:18.960
the real world lost its meaning to me.

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:23.380
But there is one desire we do share.

00:13:23.590 --> 00:13:25.090
For me, a world without Haruto.

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:27.800
For you, a world without Asahi.

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:31.010
Go back to reality, Satsuki.

00:13:31.350 --> 00:13:34.430
I'll make it game over for Haruto.

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:37.690
We should divide the world.

00:13:39.650 --> 00:13:42.530
Well, I was told there's a possibility

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:45.990
you might surrender after hearing this message.

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:47.450
What's your answer?

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:53.830
So that's your answer.

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:55.500
It hurts to say this...

00:13:55.660 --> 00:13:59.080
You'll serve as the foundation of the Brill Society.

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:01.460
As of your surrender.

00:14:02.090 --> 00:14:05.220
Surrender? I'm going to lose?

00:14:05.550 --> 00:14:07.470
To what?

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:10.260
-I don't want to lose.
-Where?

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:11.600
To who?

00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:13.140
To them?

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:14.470
To Takanori?

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:17.100
I don't care!
Get rid of Innocensia!

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:22.230
I don't have time for you fools right now!

00:14:22.690 --> 00:14:24.230
I'll think about things later!

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:26.740
Flames of Eternal Dominion!

00:14:27.110 --> 00:14:29.410
In one shot! Here I go!

00:14:32.160 --> 00:14:35.750
I have to get to Haruto--
No. To Asahi!

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:38.250
What's that?

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:53.760
Once a legend, always a legend.

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:57.020
You must have been amazing in your prime.

00:14:57.640 --> 00:15:02.270
I admit it,
I can't win against you one-on-one!

00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:04.270
Then leave this place.

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:06.900
Don't show your face ever again.

00:15:07.190 --> 00:15:08.820
Stop blabbering.

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:12.030
Do you really think you can escape from my followers?

00:15:12.370 --> 00:15:14.530
What a waste of your strength.

00:15:15.240 --> 00:15:17.660
Join me, Coeur de Lion!

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:19.870
-Together, our Fighting Sense--
-I refuse!

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:21.120
You fool!

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:26.130
Fire!

00:15:32.430 --> 00:15:33.550
Oh, dear.

00:15:38.020 --> 00:15:41.810
You never think about the consequences.

00:15:42.230 --> 00:15:45.230
What's wrong with these arrows?
They won't come out!

00:15:45.480 --> 00:15:46.690
You... Elicia?

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:50.490
She's just one more! It's no big deal!

00:15:51.990 --> 00:15:54.870
The Empath Sense, Ideal Fall.

00:15:55.030 --> 00:15:58.700
When these arrows hit their target,
their Sense is sealed away.

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:02.960
Their Sense is sealed?
I've never heard of that before.

00:16:03.120 --> 00:16:05.960
Well, then, let's escape while he's powerless.

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:07.880
Don't underestimate me! Fire!

00:16:08.460 --> 00:16:10.130
Mortar Arrow!

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:13.510
Ideal Fall Divide!

00:16:19.060 --> 00:16:20.060
My Sense!

00:16:20.600 --> 00:16:21.810
I can't use it!

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:23.810
Come out, elemental!

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:30.820
Hurry. Asahi is in danger.

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:38.830
Why are you doing this?

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:43.580
I just wanted to restore Subaru with everyone.

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:47.170
I know this sounds cruel,
but I want you to understand, Asahi.

00:16:47.670 --> 00:16:52.340
For us, six years have passed.
We can't return things to the way they were.

00:16:52.510 --> 00:16:54.300
There you go again.

00:16:54.470 --> 00:16:59.720
Everyone keeps saying, "Six years have gone by.
You have to understand."

00:16:59.890 --> 00:17:01.350
That's impossible!

00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:04.480
Time hasn't gone by for me at all!

00:17:06.560 --> 00:17:09.110
I'm sad that I can't log out.

00:17:09.270 --> 00:17:13.650
But I'm even more sad that I can't play
with everyone anymore.

00:17:13.820 --> 00:17:16.990
You just fight with Haruto.

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:20.120
Asahi... You--

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:23.000
Let's form Subaru together again, Takanori.

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:25.830
With everyone. Just like before.

00:17:27.420 --> 00:17:29.840
We can't. I...

00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:34.090
The only way...

00:17:35.090 --> 00:17:37.970
I can control my feelings
is to fight him.

00:17:39.260 --> 00:17:43.100
I'll clear up this misunderstanding,
even if I have to use force.

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:46.600
Takanori!

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:51.110
Make her lose consciousness.

00:17:56.110 --> 00:17:59.450
Takanori...

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:04.870
Wait!
I never said it was okay for you to touch Asahi!

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:08.370
Stop!

00:18:19.390 --> 00:18:23.350
If Takanori tries to get Asahi Kuga back,

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:25.730
self-explode immediately.

00:18:26.350 --> 00:18:27.890
Angelus.

00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:30.270
No wonder I didn't notice.

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:33.820
He hid his Empath Sense in the fog I made.

00:18:34.150 --> 00:18:37.700
It's ineffective on those in the same class
as Asahi, Satsuki, and Haruto...

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:40.410
but it could work
on intermediate players like these.

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:43.240
You bastards!
Snap out of it!

00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:49.460
Damn! I can't get them all!

00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:51.580
Stop the brainwashed ones.

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:53.380
But don't hurt them!

00:18:54.840 --> 00:18:56.260
-Don't let them get away!
-Yes!

00:19:01.590 --> 00:19:03.140
Wait! Don't go!

00:19:05.220 --> 00:19:09.100
Asahi!

00:19:17.360 --> 00:19:19.530
What's going on?

00:19:20.150 --> 00:19:22.910
Southern Cross and the Brill Society

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:25.910
have merged into one as of today.

00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:31.620
We are now the strongest guild,
both in terms of numbers and force!

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:35.550
And we have the Prophet Art!

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:37.420
The Prophet Art?

00:19:37.710 --> 00:19:39.920
Isn't that the power to see the future?

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:43.300
It's a legendary Sense, right? Seriously?

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:48.810
This is our opportunity
to rebuild a new world order in Re'Union.

00:19:49.270 --> 00:19:53.020
Now we are a new guild called Divine.

00:19:53.190 --> 00:19:54.360
Join us under Divine!

00:19:55.900 --> 00:19:59.690
So this means Takanori was betrayed.

00:20:02.610 --> 00:20:04.870
Hey, I hope you reconsider, Haruto.

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:08.830
All right. I have my weapons and my items.

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:11.210
I'll take what I lack from the enemy.

00:20:11.370 --> 00:20:13.080
This is no time to say that!

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:16.090
Divine is at least 3000 strong!

00:20:16.460 --> 00:20:18.840
Only an idiot would attack without a plan.

00:20:19.050 --> 00:20:20.130
I don't care!

00:20:21.550 --> 00:20:25.350
They just want the Prophet Art, not Asahi.

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:30.770
They'd stop at nothing to make Asahi
do what they tell her, even if she doesn't want to.

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:33.390
I can't let them do that.

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:35.520
I'm going to save Asahi.

00:20:36.230 --> 00:20:39.280
Even if it's game over for me.

00:20:41.900 --> 00:20:44.280
Satsuki, don't come.

00:20:44.450 --> 00:20:47.450
-What are you talking about?
-I can tell just by looking at you.

00:20:47.700 --> 00:20:52.040
You're unsure about something,
and you'll struggle using your Sense like that.

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:54.290
That's not true.

00:20:54.710 --> 00:20:56.710
If I fail...

00:20:57.290 --> 00:21:00.710
then go get Asahi back with Takanori.

00:21:00.960 --> 00:21:02.340
If I'm not involved,

00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:05.010
I'm sure he will be happy to help.

00:21:05.180 --> 00:21:06.300
But...

00:21:07.800 --> 00:21:08.810
Hey, Satsuki...

00:21:10.140 --> 00:21:13.180
Back then...
If we were the same as back then,

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:16.400
we'd give up anything to save her, right?

00:21:17.940 --> 00:21:20.570
When you get rid of your doubts...

00:21:25.320 --> 00:21:27.280
Haruto.

00:21:54.600 --> 00:21:57.100
It looks like I won't be getting out of this alive.

00:21:59.560 --> 00:22:02.230
But I still have to save my friend.

00:22:02.480 --> 00:22:04.820
I have to save Asahi.

00:22:05.650 --> 00:22:07.530
As long as this will survives,

00:22:07.910 --> 00:22:11.490
Subaru will never disappear. Never.

00:22:12.580 --> 00:22:15.290
You gave everything back to me.

00:22:15.750 --> 00:22:20.670
So I'm going to risk my life
to get you back.

00:22:21.670 --> 00:22:22.960
Here I go!

00:23:56.600 --> 00:23:58.930
They won't kill Asahi immediately.

00:23:59.100 --> 00:24:01.140
-You're pretty calm.
-Not at all!

00:24:01.310 --> 00:24:03.980
There's so much to think about!

00:24:04.150 --> 00:24:06.150
Episode 6,
"The Lion and the Dragon Unite."

00:24:06.320 --> 00:24:08.150
It's hard having attachments.

00:24:08.320 --> 00:24:09.360
Yeah!
